Jurídica y/o supervisor.","actividad":"<p><span>8.1 Asistió a la reunión denominada <i>\\u201cREVISIÓN\\nY AJUSTE PLAN DE ORDENAMIENTO TERRITORIAL\\u201d<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p>"},{"obligacion":"9.Las demás actividades que le asigne el supervisor del contrato y que se encuentren directamente relacionadas con el objeto contractual.","actividad":"<p><span><span>9.<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><span>Realizó el\\ndiligenciamiento de la base de Seguimiento a Proyecto de Inversión BP 26005460\\n- JULIO 2026.<\\/span><\\/p>"}]', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ljtorlvCOvJWXGg_1Av7WkzbfZ0IuKtP?usp=sharing', '0561', '{"evidencia_3_0":{"name":"4.1 Revisión y ajustes CALI 2026 - Apelación auto que decretar medida cautelar 2026-0098.docx","id":"1cmqxyZDjCj-m4Ju3TFU49dMDRJYjnZNK","url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1cmqxyZDjCj-m4Ju3TFU49dMDRJYjnZNK/view"},"evidencia_2_0":{"name":"3.1 Observaciones articulado del 150 al 195.docx","id":"1CmR4RTcnkyX1zB9ExwpTWyhN-47BoDAw","url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CmR4RTcnkyX1zB9ExwpTWyhN-47BoDAw/view"},"evidencia_0_0":{"name":"1.1 202641210100055714_00001.docx","id":"1SoP6z8JYODtKR1kPGKg-ef7spBjjX9JV","url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1SoP6z8JYODtKR1kPGKg-ef7spBjjX9JV/view"},"evidencia_1_0":{"name":"2.1 202641210100050394_00001d.docx","id":"1yqYPzfVkeB_GDODMuSHJdn1X8LqGZihg","url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1yqYPzfVkeB_GDODMuSHJdn1X8LqGZihg/view"},"evidencia_7_0":{"name":"8.1 Reunión No. 1 POT.pdf","id":"1wZGmx0WV-pdWSCGxMKAE4ZHM14tLw365","url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wZGmx0WV-pdWSCGxMKAE4ZHM14tLw365/view"},"evidencia_5_0":{"name":"6.1 202641210100050334_00001d.docx","id":"1guACu-9f1WjdU1CLE34vhfVXvdm9xQAe","url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1guACu-9f1WjdU1CLE34vhfVXvdm9xQAe/view"},"evidencia_4_0":{"name":"5.1 202641210100053574_00001.pdf","id":"1ynWNE6uLjDY2nm0Yr8LyAFuPlUC0mOAs","url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ynWNE6uLjDY2nm0Yr8LyAFuPlUC0mOAs/view"},"evidencia_0_0_1"